# Supabase (browser read path) — REQUIRED for live data.
# The frontend reads daily bars from your Supabase `prices` table using the ANON
# public key (safe to ship; RLS grants read-only, denies writes). Find both under
# Project Settings -> API in your Supabase dashboard.
# Without these, the app runs on a simulated feed and shows a "DEMO / simulated" pill.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Server-side only (NOT used by the frontend) ---------------------------
# The Tiingo token lives as a Supabase *secret* used by the Edge Function
# collector, never in the client bundle. Set it in your project with:
#   supabase secrets set TIINGO_KEY=your_tiingo_token
# (kept here only as a reminder; do not put it in a VITE_ var).

# --- Finnhub real-time quotes (browser-direct) -----------------------------
# OPTIONAL. Enables near-real-time last prices on the trade screen, backtest
# valuation, and the Finnhub pipeline-health indicator. Tiingo still drives all
# daily bars and signals; without this token those screens simply fall back to
# the prior daily close (no live prices, no errors).
#
# Finnhub's free /quote endpoint is CORS-enabled, so this token ships in the
# client bundle (a VITE_ var is browser-exposed BY DESIGN). Use only a FREE,
# personal-use key here — the worst case if it leaks is someone burning your
# free quota. Never put a paid key in a VITE_ var.
# Get a free key at https://finnhub.io/  (free tier ~60 requests/minute).
VITE_FINNHUB_TOKEN=
